# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Gmail SMTP (Recommended & Easiest for Real Inbox Delivery)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification in your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter your gmail and the 16-character password below (remove the '#' comments):
# SMTP_SERVICE=gmail
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your_16_char_app_password
# SMTP_FROM=DataGalactic <your_email@gmail.com>

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: Custom / Hosted SMTP (Zoho, Brevo, SendGrid, Hostinger, AWS SES, cPanel)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your_smtp_user
# SMTP_PASS=your_smtp_password
# SMTP_FROM="DataGalactic" <hello@datagalactic.in>
